+## Routes
+
+The full list is in `README.md`. Routes with more to say:
+
+### `POST /import/sales`
+
+Body `{ "csv": "..." }` with the columns `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`
+(`soldAt` an ISO instant, `qty` a whole number of portions). Each row uses
+`qty` portions of the dish's recipe. Answers
+`{ "tickets": <count>, "dishes": <count> }` for what was imported (`dishes`
+is the sum of `qty`). Tickets imported before are skipped. If a row is
+invalid (`bad_request`, 400) or an item runs out (`sale_out_of_stock`, 409),
+nothing is imported and the message names the row (`row 2` is the first
+data row).
+
+### `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD`
+
+One line per item, by item id:
+`{ itemId, name, unit, theoretical, actual, difference }`, where
+`theoretical` is recipe use of sales sold in those days (inclusive),
+`actual` every `consume` movement in those days and
+`difference = actual - theoretical`. Items with neither are left out.
