+## Sales
+
+- A sale is one till line: `ticket`, `soldAt` (instant), `dishId`, `qty`,
+  and `uses`, the ingredients its recipe portions took (`scaled`, 3
+  decimals). Its stock is consumed at `soldAt` with ref `sale:<ticket>`.
+- A ticket is imported once; importing it again is skipped. An import is
+  all or nothing.
+- Variance for days `from`..`to` (inclusive, by UTC day): theoretical use is
+  the sum of `uses` of sales sold in those days, actual use the sum of every
+  `consume` movement in those days; difference = actual - theoretical.
